          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಮಾರ್ಪಡಿಸು — mārpaḍisu — \"to modify\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ದರ್ಜಿ ನನ್ನ ಅಂಗಿಯನ್ನು ಸ್ವಲ್ಪ ಮಾರ್ಪಡಿಸಿದನು. darji nanna aṅgiyannu svalpa mārpaḍisidanu. The tailor altered my shirt a little."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): ಮಾರ್ಪಡಿಸಿದೆ, mārpaḍiside."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಮಾರ್ಪಾಡು, a change."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಮಾರ್ಪಡಿಸು (mārpaḍisu) is the causative of mārpaḍu, \"to change\", and is usually traced to native māṟu, \"to be opposite, to take or give one thing for another\" (DEDR 4834), the root of ಮಾರು, \"to sell\"; DEDR does not list the verb itself, so the formation is not settled."
            }
          ]
        },
